        "affiliation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "src-bf6ac2de2a7289a3",
      "quote": "Current active major grants funding the Ginsberg laboratory investigations include the following. Cell Adhesion Mechanisms in Vascular Disease and Thrombosis, a research program project funded by the National Heart, Lung, and Blood Institute (NHLBI) KRIT1 and Vascular Integrity, an R01 research grant from NHLBI Dr. Ginsberg leads two subprojects within Integrin Signaling in Hemostasis and Blood Diseases, an NHLBI research program project whose principal investigator is UC San Diego colleague Sanford Shattil, MD: Protein Expression and Purification Suppressors of Integrin Activation",
      "supports": [
        "research",
        "topics"
      ]
    }
